the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 10.

the actions are:
    the politician called *a name* stops being honest; known as politician_stops_being_honest.

the fluents are:
    there is a hope; known as hope.
    there is a politician called *a name*; known as politician.
    the politician called *a name* is honest; known as politician_honest.

the knowledge base honest_politician includes:

the text of the rule base is at "sources/HonestPolitician.drl".

% Rule "We have an honest Politician": insertLogical, so the fact holds as long as its conditions do (Drools' truth maintenance) — an intensional fluent
there is a hope at a time if
    the politician called a name is honest at the time.

