% Rule "Corrupt the Honest"; its Java, not translated: System.out.println( "I'm an evil corporation and I have corrupted " + politician.getName() );
if the politician called a name is honest
    and there is a hope
then the politician called the name stops being honest.

when the politician called a name stops being honest
then it is not the case that the politician called the name is honest.

initially there is a politician called President of Umpa Lumpa
    and the politician called President of Umpa Lumpa is honest
    and there is a politician called Prime Minster of Cheeseland
    and the politician called Prime Minster of Cheeseland is honest
    and there is a politician called Tsar of Pringapopaloo
    and the politician called Tsar of Pringapopaloo is honest
    and there is a politician called Omnipotence Om
    and the politician called Omnipotence Om is honest.

